---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout>
    <section class="flex flex-col gap-y-4">
        <section>
            <h1 class="text-xl font-semibold border-b">About</h1>
            <p>
                I'm Xander, a developer in Edmonton, Alberta, and I like having
                weird ideas and letting them grow into real tools. My interests
                span software development, hardware engineering, robotics, local
                inference, and game design, but a lot of what I make still comes
                down to where the wind takes me.
            </p>
            <p>
                Beneath the above all being computer-related, I've found that Da
                Computer has become less the actual <i>subject</i> of my exploration,
                and more a tool for orchestrating it. <a
                    href="https://softwarequotes.com/quote/everything-really-interesting-that-happens-in-soft"
                    target="_blank"
                    class="underline"
                    >The most interesting things in software always lead back to
                    people</a
                >, after all.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h1 class="text-xl font-semibold border-b">Projects</h1>
            <p>projects</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h1 class="text-xl font-semibold border-b">Contact</h1>
            <p>
                I like weird propositions; you can send them to me at <a
                    href="mailto:hello@xandwr.com"
                    class="underline">hello@xandwr.com</a
                >.
            </p>
        </section>
    </section>
</BaseLayout>
